{title: Tumse Achha Kaun Hai}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Jaanwar}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]Tumse achcha kaun hai,        [G]dil lo jigar lo [D]jaan lo
[D]hum tumhare hain sanam,        [G]tum hamhey pehchaan lo
[G]Main hoon woh johka mast hawa ka,        [G]sang tumhare [D]chalta rahunga
[D]jabse hui hai tumse mohabbat,        [C]milta raha hoon [G]milta rahunga
[G]tumse achcha kaun hai...        [G]Sine me dil hai dil main tumhi ho
[G]tumse hamari [D]chotisi jaan hai,        [D]tum ho salamat humko nahin ghum
[C]tumse hamari [G]duniya jawan hai,        [G]tumse achcha kaun hai
